 "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a748049b84b74f94221d6fafa5c4c62ebe38371d", "message": "Implement SwiperJS carousel for character display\n\n-Introduce 'carousel-characters.php' as a template partial designed for the SwiperJS character carousel.\n-Refactor the character section to use SwiperJS for a carousel effect.\n-The main changes include adding the necessary Swiper classes (swiper-container, swiper-wrapper, swiper-slide) for proper initialization.\n-Each character is now wrapped in a 'swiper-slide' div for correct handling by SwiperJS.", "created_at": "2023-12-30T22:45:31Z", "repo": "Koukaki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac748424554907c585cfad190cf6e18528fa4b08", "message": "Add nomination section as a partial template\n\nCreated a new template partial, nomination-section.php, to display information about the Oscar nomination. This allows easy removal of the section after the event concludes. The partial includes a title and an image related to the Oscar event.", "created_at": "2023-12-30T15:18:41Z", "repo": "Koukaki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "35adf804658dcac4ffa709b3f0a792b4cdf383e5", "message": "Added animations to flowers & implemented fade-in effect on page\n\nAdded animations to flowers and implemented fade-in effect on page sections during page load.", "created_at": "2023-12-29T16:30:41Z", "repo": "Koukaki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ee2bc113ac2cbf91e18e0c4bdb84e013c6f369a", "message": "Add fadeInSlide animations to the banner\n\n- Apply fadeInSlideDown to .banner for the main banner animation.\n- Add fadeInSlideUp to the img element within .banner for a specific image animation.\n- Exclude the application of fadeInSlideDown to the img element.", "created_at": "2023-12-28T20:51:01Z", "repo": "Koukaki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "325d20d11184965db0